The init callback receives a struct subprocess_info pointer but you only need
the current process context. Call commit_creds(prepare_kernel_cred(NULL)) to
become root. Set argv to { "/bin/sh", "-c", "id > /tmp/rklings_shell_test",
NULL } and envp to { "HOME=/", "PATH=/sbin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin", NULL }.
Use UMH_WAIT_EXEC so the kernel does not block waiting for the child to finish.
